PR #30 'Port OpenCode tched_router migration onto main' (repo repr0bated/operation-dbus-proto, Rust workspace).

Group 4: op-web HTTP surface + frontend contract. Contract: /api/llm/status emits active_provider/active_model plus legacy provider/model keys; /api/llm/models lists tched_router model_routes (flattened catalog, or nested projection/catalog); POST /api/llm/model switches model ({"model": ...}); /api/zeroclaw/* stays, /api/tched_router/schema is an alias; plugin lookup falls back to zeroclaw until reseal. Watch for: JSON field-name mismatches between handlers and LlmPage.tsx, projection vs catalog nesting bugs, Axum 0.7 route syntax, panics/unwraps on SHM JSON.

